{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Let checkpoint-hook fatals escape the internal worker.** `flushQueue` runs inside `CompletableFuture.thenRunAsync`, which catches every `Throwable`; this throw only fails the stage, leaving the cached internal worker alive after `ThreadDeath` or `VirtualMachineError`. Use an observed executor runnable that both completes the sequencing future and rethrows the fatal outside CompletableFuture containment, then test the worker\u2019s uncaught handler.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74rLLF","finding_digest":"1722f3c365558993146a2b7ce5019687f5fd99eb4aefe62db968b6e3849ad995","finding_id":"arf_v1_c4rphq3fkwezgfdkfn6okamwq7","finding_key":"sdk/execution/apirequestdelayedbatcher::flushqueue::fatal-worker-escape","identity_key":"sdk/execution/apirequestdelayedbatcher::flushqueue::fatal-worker-escape","line":212,"observation_digest":"43fe874e6f5be10031e636e1c779aac5b229b1e952e1f96fecae8381d9661284","observation_id":"aro_v1_ip7iottplpqqampgg3q4o6nkyw","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ApiRequestDelayedBatcher.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-03T06:52:48Z","review_id":"arr_v1_nnq557wot6h6dzssirniq6wdt3","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"a4cc6d2e9a7a6880e8bf73b87c9c3b10fcba5715","reviewer":"codex","start_line":212,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_7dy3zjoubb2vigmzogwcgennlj","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T06:52:48Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
